Subject: Answer a FindService carrying Unicast Flag = 0

vsomeip drops any FindService whose SD Unicast Flag is 0: the else branch
of send_uni_or_multicast_offerservice() is empty, citing SIP_SD_91 ("Find
messages received with Unicast Flag set to 0 (multicast), shall be
ignored"). No solicited OfferService ever leaves the stack for such a Find.

TC8 §5.1.5.4.4 SOMEIPSRV_SD_BEHAVIOR_04 and §5.1.6 SOMEIP_ETS_130 assert
the opposite reading, the one PRS_SOMEIPSD_00268 / 00305 / 00306 / 00307
carries: the server answers a FindService and the Unicast Flag does not
suppress that answer. SD_BEHAVIOR_04 further asserts the answer is
multicast. With upstream behaviour the assertion is unobservable on a
Linux DUT — SD_BEHAVIOR_04 lands `inconclusive_no_offer_after_multicast_find`,
and ETS_130 only ever passes on an unrelated cyclic OfferService drifting
into its listen window.

This patch answers such a Find with a multicast OfferService. The Unicast
Flag = 1 path (SID_SD_826 / SIP_SD_89 / SIP_SD_90) is untouched, so the
half-offer-delay unicast-vs-multicast choice every other case depends on
keeps its upstream behaviour.

Affects:
  implementation/service_discovery/src/service_discovery_impl.cpp
Index: vsomeip/implementation/service_discovery/src/service_discovery_impl.cpp
===================================================================
--- vsomeip.orig/implementation/service_discovery/src/service_discovery_impl.cpp
+++ vsomeip/implementation/service_discovery/src/service_discovery_impl.cpp
@@ -2818,8 +2818,11 @@ void service_discovery_impl::send_uni_or
             send_multicast_offer_service(_info);
         }
     } else {
-        // SIP_SD_91
-        // Find messages received with Unicast Flag set to 0 (multicast), shall be ignored
+        // SIP_SD_91 relaxed for TC8 conformance: PRS_SOMEIPSD_00268/00305/00306/00307
+        // require the server to answer a FindService regardless of the Unicast Flag,
+        // and TC8 asserts the multicast answer. Answer with a multicast OfferService
+        // instead of dropping the Find.
+        send_multicast_offer_service(_info);
     }
 }
